flowchart LR
 Req[Requirements / Prior Phase Gates] --> Val[Integrated Validation]
 Val --> UAT[UAT]
 UAT --> Pilot[Pilot]
 Pilot --> Mig[Migration Dry Run / Reconciliation]
 Mig --> Ready[Cutover Readiness]
 Ready --> Go{Go / No-Go}
 Go -->|No-Go| Fix[Resolve Defects / Risks]
 Fix --> Val
 Go -->|Go| Prod[Production Cutover]
 Prod --> Verify[Production Verification]
 Verify --> Hyper[Hypercare]
 Hyper --> Cert[Final Certification / Archive]
